# Sugar is not an electrolyte
# Expectation: A 0.001 mol sucrose dose should not increase conductivity like an equal NaCl dose; any missing conductivity model should be explicit.
register lv3
add v1 water 100mL
add v1 sucrose 0.001mol
new
add v2 water 100mL
add v2 NaCl 0.001mol
measure v1 conductivity
measure v2 conductivity
